  "reasoning": "The defendant virtually issued VAT special invoices for drug companies and also virtually issued motor vehicle sales unified invoices, which are not covered by the VAT special invoice provision. This constitutes the crime of falsifying VAT special invoices and the crime of falsifying other types of invoices. Both are separate offenses under the Criminal Law and should be punished together.",
